OL,3,AGerman spies handed new powers to
OL,4,Atackle 'hybrid threats' from abroad
OL,5,
OL,6,FGermany's foreign and domestic
OL,7,Fintelligence services are to be given
OL,8,Fgreater powers to combat espionage,
OL,9,Fterrorism and sabotage after the
OL,10,Fcountry's parliament, the Bundestag,
OL,11,Fapproved a major overhaul of its
OL,12,Flegislation.
OL,14,FInterior Minister Alexander Dobrindt,
OL,15,Fwho championed the bill, has called it
OL,16,Fa "reform of the century", necessary
OL,17,Fbecause of the increasing threats from
OL,18,Fforeign powers.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
