OL,3,AGerman spies handed new powers to
OL,4,Atackle 'hybrid threats' from abroad
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut the Left Party's security
OL,7,Fspokeswoman, Clara Bunger, said
OL,8,FDobrindt was creating a new German
OL,9,Fsecret police.
OL,11,FThe legislation gives numerous new
OL,12,Fpowers to Germany's BND federal
OL,13,Fintelligence service, and its BfV
OL,14,Fdomestic service, the Federal Office
OL,15,Ffor the Protection of the Constitution.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
